Agora SDK Plus is original work — additive, Agora-only SDK features that build on top of
the @agora-sdk/* packages. It does NOT contain Replyke source code; it consumes
@agora-sdk/core (the Replyke-derived fork) as an ordinary published dependency. The fork's
Replyke attribution lives in that package's own NOTICE, not here.

The secure-chat packages implement the client side of Agora's end-to-end-encrypted chat
(MLS / RFC 9420). The wire contract and the SecureChatCrypto seam originate in the Agora
server (github.com/jenova-marie/agora-server), also authored by Jenova Marie; transitional
local copies in this repo are slated to be replaced by the published
@agora-sdk/secure-chat-contract and @agora-sdk/secure-chat-crypto packages.

